    {
      "name": "Hands and Glass",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "3. Hands and Glass",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "3. 針とガラス",
            "zh": "3. 指针与表镜"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Watches lose their original hands more often than you might think. Original hands are thick and cream-colored; replacements are thin sticks in a bright yellow.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "時計の針は、意外とよく失われます。正規の針は太くクリーム色で、替えの針は明るい黄色の細い棒です。",
            "zh": "手表丢失原装指针的情况比想象中常见。原装指针又粗又是奶白色，更换的指针是亮黄色的细棍。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
