    {
      "name": "Emblem",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "4. Emblem",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "4. 紋章",
            "zh": "4. 纹章"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 92,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 36,
          "text": "Every genuine Haldane watch has this emblem printed on its dial, below the 12 o'clock mark: a round ring around an eight-toothed gear with a hole in its center.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ハルデーンの時計の文字盤には、12時の指標の下に必ずこの紋章が印刷されています。輪に囲まれた、中心に穴のある8枚歯の歯車です。",
            "zh": "每块正品霍尔丹手表的表盘上，12点标记下方都印有这个纹章：圆环围着一个八齿齿轮，中心有孔。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 132,
          "w": 72,
          "h": 54,
          "sprite": "wg_emb_genuine",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 187,
          "w": 102,
          "h": 12,
          "text": "Genuine",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "正規",
            "zh": "正品"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
